    <section class="d-none card"><div class="card-body">
The results of the Newcomer Jack&Jill final during Festival City Swing Edinburgh 2026 in  United Kingdom at 05/29/2026.<br />
<br />
Judges in this round were Pilar Lopez de Luzuriaga, Chloe Winzar, Coleen Man, Britny Delp, Miquel Menéndez and Susan Minor.    </div></section>

